    "title": "Chesapeake announces temporary delays in trash collection services - South Tidewater News",
    "text": "Trash collection services in Chesapeake will experience delays through Saturday, November 15. Waste Management is working to address the backlog in trash pick-up. Residents are advised to leave their bins at the curb until collection occurs.\nA statement from city officials reads: “There will be delays with trash pick-up for the remainder of this week through Saturday, November 15. Waste Management is actively catching up on trash collection, so please continue to leave your trash bins out until picked up. We apologize for any inconvenience and we thank you for your patience.”\nThe City of Chesapeake encourages residents to reach out for more information if needed.",
